然而，随着领导人就所需变革的速度和规模争论不休，围绕气候行动的政治共识正在破裂。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;本周的&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;《零》&lt;/em&gt;节目中， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/KHK-gO5jarUkXPQDU2wbwlWFst_LAZ7UhbWk4YfHtUKATWtKZxpxNN7JAPl9CbaxXe13awoF4UAa8y0WYMQYce4U3HV7hSO6HgsDT1Xu_eQrktO7JynLUlE5bMg2gSAdO34kqKJNy8eykJIsHRgMQAyvAOGf7dzLzWyWRUScKUzgOkyupK4GbTI48kz3szmsbU5GgEMdGs-x_3r7zcsFHasT1B7ZrrXYTzH2SFSimgGy_LF9BoUH-7VMf7hfJpGWzJVwSoU4eB_sJJiNKuO5YkfbarVyzrjHUw7IuEBmZvWO7azvcq5effe107dC3ZIXiNGcVzemYzu5r1HbiVY2M6y1YyncZa59NUlKfBgGqcpfsDm-XQIuKGPa73eUET7k4YXYlq1MP7rfdi4WZ12odGGkHFUM96dUn7mt_WZac8uu0mWifEJXdnRL4idwT0kLmJG6VrAp30SOSNAz-mzjxmjXwNXoq1BW8do6NpCiB9_Ozg/2KGGBTVbESsaemqGEPyPI4mGtxKfnaOp/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="Akshat Rathi - 高级记者：气候 |布隆伯格"&gt;阿克沙特·拉蒂 (Akshat Rathi)&lt;/a&gt;与英国绿党前党魁、担任议会议员 14 年的卡罗琳·卢卡斯 (Caroline Lucas) 进行了对话，讨论了气候变化对国家安全构成的日益严重的威胁，以及她在气候政治前线四十年的经验教训。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;立即收听，并在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/MlnOu3aPDSEf6rfOW5fqBNhX51m3Hm0U4jstJ6plt6n9cdYLRGTUVKrIYAr71nTjMpj3rzCVMHL-2t33QXQ0vYZGk2hc1akl2aD1xCtMVgCV_tHQjmVyKFf-nVrIHVV_-kRLxSgrEV-iiXWHzy0op4F2WwL2eCuN2kaf8favxV9tJrSY0oOkK-4PrRc87hDNBBnPWIp3Zoi-HE1w5gTtDT5KN9voVAyRFW6TPkcJMuZ8C2W7o6g7CS4OXs4JPxUQ1SsAee6oSMZSg56M0XIKj-pGBM-jan5HkgS7LiNXEe0OzDhDabCUJusLVA3KHuTuzqnAIw/GIA_RAQuObkteqKMJlQdko5hJVAznKHT/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="零：气候竞赛"&gt;Apple&lt;/a&gt; 、 &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/X_VI5ZcfjJVuFxRVPuLivmlXqVuPbUdElNdWFCFpDg3yIvNtCyUl9jasWlsW7rKTkp8J4tPJT5AScQ-9vv8wEftk1tqwc06yOTV2WefhA_CB3ird4iVlW78_fhEcpHYRNXvT_oqOT_6vVmlOoxkL3uIXk_lmZw8wTN2CbsvhC871pHLhsn5wHVv76GejkYRyOw-OpDQvafZinz2aaoKmJV-glkYKMVCQjOwiqUR9Vm42PqzxZkffH_jP92_I9E636GG6hlYm3TOdq1lEQBF1DjomTHHVzxX8_f7gKaBOMIXRujpiA4jP-TjOR6sYieye4Tm0GT3jt-TEk3iAyN4syzQRosjd/l8I