x; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;全球必读&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;消息人士称，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;乌克兰总统泽连斯基&lt;/strong&gt;对央行行长安德里·皮什尼&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/cMxk0vWxTytsoAgUt65QblCiLpd4Qu05Nd0gDax4bAgSBD1yscM9x16iNxe1nyibkB-gM6Cbxbp95gnGlQ7oPWeKWyAXBOwsoPxVOVpfY5bnxJS37xocz2E2Koy8vHCmf3EBKPNCuTXQSMI9B3IgaG2Dy9hbiyD9NlQYNietp5yZDPKsKKOIQLzlCfE-depa_uJKhl1q8NVWobAl92mViiOfy9Guxe8fAOBxG9XaLlTYzaGJ7NrcICxeWld22oDwgUOMQBv41jUM3tg-4cMdrmehTfpW6pr48ThoShKkwtXLPpGXOz3YKX7OUgLRe3-DMea4z4hnqKm7FclUMKx_fs1xsIjb90xHgyczgGKKs7ORAg9YiLU5h7aYcNi_OVTDBurOJHgVd8mN7vvvdaObo9QMN4TEnXbNeEAOuz2rdWE_LMomz9REyJGAjOT7o495leGGi-KMwTlsEnmLz6WJyn8YgVHpRZhHu_DmvykwkOy4qtAOAFGJi0hp_999Kg-W83JQWx7h-iIdLBfGAUCYDJ9TOhUUY1c7LkG-DycwBQ/nh26-xIbg36TUZ9NNXZ3C6SwSocCT1ld/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="泽伦斯基因与国际货币基金组织的关系而失去对其央行行长的信任"&gt;越来越不满&lt;/a&gt;，认为他与国际货币基金组织关系过于密切，而且在支持战时经济方面做得不够。泽伦斯基不打算罢免皮什尼，至少目前是这样，并且没有看到强有力的候选人来取代在与俄罗斯的战争的大部分时间里领导该银行的行长。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;面对必要的弹药短缺&lt;/strong&gt;和对继续不受欢迎的战争的警惕，特朗普和他的高级官员正在回到与伊朗政权&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/mCHOeFL8sAJQ-TrFjovHwhgdcWKoE5DHyKOiA34hJSQOyIHmjZ4ge3r2hueDEf1U9mDFVo6Q3cLMbGxYGA9t7S4nI2-A8Oivlq0zPUkSe4AAQJVrQAXSDxoLMp9NLP_RFigTbumrUu5f42n0PAd0hxWbukaSmDN7UbLD72EsIDB_Pk5G4BmIkyRCuemcrZ7wJeL9ULhy_zxLWvos2pDxQ6TCARm8LN7mvogaRSZ5blziKZ4djTyoRuTzcrMalbshD9bHVrX36Xijs9RfJSB-H8yrSr3-UA-1d9xAoxSOAUx9YZ9N4z04kt3OYRJRCrP95lvt5cMiPLvtl6r1BE-bTBkoIdIY7jL4oQnhKbPOqc_qEaM268X5M33LncGFJVdXnDeMnIMj4w8N9uTAEXPjjbZ94DbB2_Va9qFq4T0bczVZIGDMG2xJPkvbWm4QFyeGUYKRqT7gVaGYPF6duYrYnjCFY4LsyXJEikx29FntfVfvcebzsEctBP8hy8uQG_EJ2UgjU_E0Yb78zg8EKTD-49COPi_cJCqpsY1-zH9NFiE/LXF-v1VykPPbtKzK-PWoAcFGc68Uwfp6/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank